libtheora 1.2.0, decoder only
-----------------------------

From https://github.com/xiph/theora, tag v1.2.0 (commit 8e48087),
unmodified. Only the files the decoder needs (lib/Makefile.am's
decoder_sources, without the legacy theora_* API wrappers and the
x86/ARM assembly) and their headers are included. libogg comes from
Emscripten's port (-sUSE_OGG=1).

libtheora is Copyright (C) 2002-2009 Xiph.org Foundation and is under
a BSD-style license: see COPYING and LICENSE.
